kind: "blog"
title: "30–40% Retrieval Edge: How AI Agents Are Disrupting Paid Backlinks — And Why Google & Microsoft Won't Stop It"
source_title: "30–40% Retrieval Edge: How AI Agents Are Disrupting Paid Backlinks — And Why Google & Microsoft Won't Stop It"
source_url: "https://thegeocommunity.com/blogs/generative-engine-optimization/30-40-percent-retrieval-edge-ai-agents-disrupting-paid-backlinks"
author: "Rohit Singh"
date: "16 Apr 2026"
status: "ready"
