source_title: "Google's AI Optimization Guide Is Useful. The GEO Hype? Not So Much."
source_url: "https://thegeocommunity.com/blogs/generative-engine-optimization/google-ai-optimization-guide-geo-hype"
author: "Rohit Singh"
date: "16 May 2026"
